    "blurb": "Orchestrate car rental bookings",
    "overview": "Orchestrate and automate the car rental booking process, including issues such as a reserved car not being available or a rented car not being returned on time.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Orchestrate and Monitor Car Rental Bookings",
    "splashDescription": "Car rental bookings are not always straightforward. The reserved car might be available but not ready for rental, or the rented car is not returned on time and additional costs need to be added. This blueprint handles these issues and others. From a business intelligence perspective, various KPIs can be defined, such as the first yield pass for the car availability or the percentage of cars not returned on time.",
